.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH orbit-sync 1  "sync " 
.SH NAME
orbit\-sync \- Send queued changes to the server and fetch the rest
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBorbit sync\fR [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-color\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Send queued changes to the server and fetch the rest
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Print one JSON object per result, with `"v":1`, instead of text
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-color\fR
Disable ANSI colors
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH EXTRA
Examples:
  orbit sync
  orbit \-\-json sync
